  "_about": "Dyno safety dash on the 1920x720 cluster, generated by design/gen_dyno.py (edit that and regenerate), after a tile dash photo from a 740i (Nov 8 2026), refitted to this car in BMW M colours: 3 x 4 readout tiles (rpm, speed, boost / oil, coolant, intake / lateral g, long g, gear with the drive mode / fuel, shift point, last shift) and tall POWER and TORQUE tiles right, two rows each. GT3's boxes shader draws the tile frames with an M light-blue strip, and a small meter layer per tile its bar (light blue, dark blue, red); a number flashes M red over its warning limit. A rev bar across the top. Every tile but GEAR is a readout slot. Clear of the hood curve and the belt light. Full screen: the theme's own clock, range and outside temperature along the bottom, BMW's gear letter left uncovered. No map window. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
